Dr. Thrain is a half-giant some eight feet tall, rotund, with yellowish skin and a manner like a [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Hlarf|Hlarf]]. He holds a doctorate in botany and speaks for [[Org/Verdant Holdings/index|Verdant Holdings]] among the guests aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]].

He is senior in the company and acts as its face while it elects a new head from within, though he says it is no sure thing that he ends up with the power. A bespectacled gnome who sits beside him holds as much authority, led the talk before the Party approached, and lets Thrain speak for the company.

He is wary of offers of alliance, asks what benefit one would bring, and keeps a grudge against the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]] over an old scuffle. The Party left him a gift of Brigadieros and went away.
